  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Donation to Vanuatu Fire Service</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A surplus of firefighting equipment was donated to the Vanuatu Fire Service to assist in increasing the natural disaster resilience of this developing Pacific Island nation. The donation included structural ppc, level 1 ppc, helmets, boots, hoses and gear, ad hoc items and a fire fighting vehicle (fully decreciated NBV), with a total cost of $184,690.00</narrative>
  </description>
